From e277517a851572f2b330106eadabc14bfe79f499 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A6 FM bring-up <a6lte-fm@localhost>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] FMRadio: add Broadcom HCI and SEC audio support

Select a separate JNI soname and opt-in device resource. Require
Bluetooth enabled and a wired antenna; follow adapter/SCO/focus
lifecycle, bound cancellation and monitor link health. Route through
the Samsung SEC HAL rather than software-looping direct FM audio.

Use per-track output selection and receiver digital volume. Keep
RDS/AF unsupported and recording UI disabled for this candidate.
Legacy devices keep the existing libfmjni and audio path.

Experimental: exact firmware response and audio route need phone
validation; a stock log is not required to build this candidate.
Base: c8664126026de37a442dba996db8bc4d3606dc41
